  "id": "Hackney-2026_0390",
  "appeal_status": null,
  "appeal_start_date": null,
  "description": "Erection of a rear first-floor extension.",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed extension, by reason of inappropriate scale, detailed design and location, would result in an unsympathetic, obtrusive and incongruous form of development, which would detrimentally impact the character and appearance of the application site, the locally listed square and wider conservation area.&amp;nbsp; As such the proposed development is contrary to policy D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) and HC1 (Heritage conservation and growth) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character), LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) and LP4 (Non Designated Heritage Assets) of the Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2025 and the NPPF.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed rear extension, by reason of its size, siting and design would appear unduly overbearing and result in an unacceptable sense of enclosure, loss of outlook, daylight / sunlight and overshadowing, detrimental to the residential amenity of neighbouring occupiers, contrary to Policy D4 of the London Plan and Policies LP1 and LP2 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
